  "displayName": "DeepSeek-V3.2",
  "provider": "DeepSeek",
  "description": "DeepSeek-V3.2 is an advanced large language model featuring a Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) architecture with 671B total parameters and 37B active parameters per token. It delivers exceptional capabilities in mathematical reasoning, code generation, and logical reasoning.",
  "zhDescription": "DeepSeek先进的大语言模型，采用混合专家（MoE）架构，总参数量达6710亿，每token激活参数370亿。在数学推理、代码生成和逻辑推理方面表现出卓越能力。该模型在提供开源权重可访问性的同时，达到了与专有模型相竞争的性能。其架构实现了高效推理，尽管参数量庞大，适用于研究、企业应用和复杂分析任务。",
  "longDescription": "DeepSeek-V3.2 is an advanced large language model featuring a Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) architecture with 671B total parameters and 37B active parameters per token. It delivers exceptional capabilities in mathematical reasoning, code generation, and logical reasoning.",
  "zhLongDescription": "DeepSeek先进的大语言模型，采用混合专家（MoE）架构，总参数量达6710亿，每token激活参数370亿。在数学推理、代码生成和逻辑推理方面表现出卓越能力。该模型在提供开源权重可访问性的同时，达到了与专有模型相竞争的性能。其架构实现了高效推理，尽管参数量庞大，适用于研究、企业应用和复杂分析任务。",
